window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-044-8a61e513d0d65d82.json"]={sha256:"8a61e513d0d65d827bae2d8712b6245180c4e097f20281647fc31dcef8600d77",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-96ecec88f91a75bd","url":"https://queracomputing.github.io/bloqade/latest/analog/home/background/","title":"Background: Neutral Atom Qubits","titleEn":"Background: Neutral Atom Qubits","publisher":"QuEra Bloqade","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-044","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-044","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-045","referenceUrls":["https://www.quera.com/neutral-atom-platform"],"title":"QuEra Rydberg 阻塞：作用半徑與頻率慣例","titleEn":"QuEra Rydberg blockade: interaction radius and frequency conventions","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付距離／作用曲線、局部線性誤差與幾何驗收圖。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver distance/interaction curves, linearization errors and geometry acceptance. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『QuEra Rydberg 阻塞：作用半徑與頻率慣例』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付半徑反算、2π慣例檢查與雙激發驗證計畫。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'QuEra Rydberg blockade: interaction radius and frequency conventions', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver inverse-radius checks,2π convention checks and pair-excitation validation plans.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：van der Waals區間V(r)=C6/r⁶；以V(r0)比值寫V(r)=V0(r0/r)⁶，避免混用角頻率與能量。 使用教學V0/h=10 MHz於r0=5 μm；不使用實際原子態的C6規格。 以手算或試算表計算名義式10*(5/5)**6，另開一欄執行獨立核對：確認V×r⁶固定；用微分δV/V≈−6δr/r只估很小擾動，不能拿20%變化直接替代精確式。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：以作用能量等於驅動能量定義教學半徑rb=(C6/(ℏΩ))^(1/6)；fR=Ω/(2π)，所以rb=r0[(V0/h)/fR]^(1/6)，括號內為無量綱頻率比。 使用合成V0/h=64 MHz於r0=3 μm、fR=1 MHz；沒有宣稱此半徑內完全零誤差。 以手算或試算表計算名義式3*(64/1)**(1/6)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：將rb代回64(3/rb)⁶應還原1或2 MHz；不可在一邊用Ω、另一邊用Hz。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: In the van der Waals regime V(r)=C6/r⁶; use V(r)=V0(r0/r)⁶ to keep angular-frequency and energy conventions consistent. Use Teaching V0/h=10 MHz at r0=5 μm; no real atomic-state C6 specification is assumed. Evaluate nominal expression 10*(5/5)**6 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check invariant V×r⁶; use δV/V≈−6δr/r only for small perturbations, not as an exact20% change.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Define teaching radius rb=(C6/(ℏΩ))^(1/6) by equal interaction and drive energies. With fR=Ω/(2π), rb=r0[(V0/h)/fR]^(1/6), using a dimensionless frequency ratio. Use Synthetic V0/h=64 MHz at r0=3 μm and fR=1 MHz; no claim of zero error inside this radius. Evaluate nominal expression 3*(64/1)**(1/6) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Substitute rb into64(3/rb)⁶ to recover1 or2 MHz; never mix Ω on one side with Hz on the other.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-054","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-08820-7"],"title":"PsiQuantum Omega：Hong–Ou–Mandel 可見度","titleEn":"PsiQuantum Omega: Hong–Ou–Mandel visibility","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付距離／作用曲線、局部線性誤差與幾何驗收圖。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver distance/interaction curves, linearization errors and geometry acceptance. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"由符合計數推導可見度，並保留背景扣除的不確定性。","differenceEn":"Derive visibility from coincidence counts while retaining uncertainty from background subtraction.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：van der Waals區間V(r)=C6/r⁶；以V(r0)比值寫V(r)=V0(r0/r)⁶，避免混用角頻率與能量。 使用教學V0/h=10 MHz於r0=5 μm；不使用實際原子態的C6規格。 以手算或試算表計算名義式10*(5/5)**6，另開一欄執行獨立核對：確認V×r⁶固定；用微分δV/V≈−6δr/r只估很小擾動，不能拿20%變化直接替代精確式。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。遠離重疊時符合計數1000，零延遲時100，曝光相同且此題不扣背景。 V=1−C零/C遠。 代入 1-100/1000，得到 0.9 dimensionless。V=(C遠−C零)/C遠；需相同曝光與穩定背景，且可見度不是完整閘保真度。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: In the van der Waals regime V(r)=C6/r⁶; use V(r)=V0(r0/r)⁶ to keep angular-frequency and energy conventions consistent. Use Teaching V0/h=10 MHz at r0=5 μm; no real atomic-state C6 specification is assumed. Evaluate nominal expression 10*(5/5)**6 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check invariant V×r⁶; use δV/V≈−6δr/r only for small perturbations, not as an exact20% change.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Far-delay coincidences1000, zero-delay coincidences100, equal exposure, no background subtraction here. V=1−Czero/Cfar. Substituting 1-100/1000 gives 0.9 dimensionless. V=(Cfar−Czero)/Cfar requires equal exposure and stable background; visibility is not full gate fidelity. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-03197d83dc430913","url":"https://www.quera.com/neutral-atom-platform","title":"Building Quantum Computers with Neutral Atoms","titleEn":"Building Quantum Computers with Neutral Atoms","publisher":"QuEra","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-ff15b0b67f0cb15d","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-08820-7","title":"A manufacturable platform for photonic quantum computing","titleEn":"A manufacturable platform for photonic quantum computing","publisher":"PsiQuantum team / Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
